where the mean and s.d. of the approximate posterior, $\bmu^{(i)}$ and $\bsigma^{(i)}$, are outputs of the encoding MLP, i.e. nonlinear functions of datapoint $\bx^{(i)}$ and the variational parameters $\bphi$ (see appendix~\ref{ap:encoders_decod

